I’ve mapped six distinct mechanisms to FS-5 through FS-10: `find` precedence, two Git index cases, inode replacement, `dotglob`, and `cp -r` destination handling. I’m building each pair so the changed fact appears in generated artifact output and the expected result comes from running the command and restore script.
